Package: genieLOT
Type: Package
Title: Line of Therapy Calculation for AACR Project GENIE BPC Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Patrick", "Charles", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "pjchar046@gmail.com")
Description: Calculates oncology lines of therapy (LOT) from AACR Project
    GENIE BioPharma Collaborative (BPC) data. Users choose their own index
    event (diagnosis, distant metastasis, progression, recurrence, or a custom
    date) and their own line rules (grouping window, treatment gap, drug swaps,
    add-on drugs). Correctly handles early-stage (I-III) patients who receive
    adjuvant or neoadjuvant therapy before a later recurrence, and quantifies
    how often simple counting from diagnosis mislabels their lines.
